-1e0c3b2d30c8|title","text":"oughta, don't hafta, wantcha"},{"key":"a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|title","text":"Berühmte extreme Verkürzung: 'Did you eat yet?'"},{"key":"e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|title","text":"'because of' und 'sort of a'"},{"key":"d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|title","text":"Lockeres Ja/Nein: yep, nope, uh-huh"},{"key":"d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|title","text":"'want a' (Ding) oder 'want to' (Handlung)"},{"key":"6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|title","text":"wouldn't have → wouldn'ta"},{"key":"2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|title","text":"just 'cause, gonna need"},{"key":"233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|title","text":"ain't — am not, is not, are not"},{"key":"dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|title","text":"gotcha — got you"},{"key":"83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|title","text":"musta, mighta — must have, might have"},{"key":"ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|title","text":"shouldn'ta, couldn'ta — verneinte Modalverben der Vergangenheit"},{"key":"7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|title","text":"g-Ausfall: doin', goin', talkin'"},{"key":"0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|title","text":"somethin', nothin', anythin'"},{"key":"cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|title","text":"'em — them"},{"key":"66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|title","text":"'n' — and"},{"key":"74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|title","text":"'cause allein — because"},{"key":"f8740e37-88d7-4e64-a74d-762766ff4593|title","text":"'course — of course"},{"key":"a1c62d96-731e-4d96-803e-33f2cd732fc7|title","text":"aight — all right"},{"key":"fd275dbf-ca1f-489e-93aa-a7928df2aa76|title","text":"letcha — let you"},{"key":"9bf1b2d8-c97b-4451-8371-0efb3b24ecd0|title","text":"jever — did you ever"},{"key":"82a1afdf-f024-41d9-bb83-15d15e39a5cf|title","text":"gonna hafta — going to have to"},{"key":"d7d2b06f-c8dd-444a-ba6e-638346e18810|title","text":"not gonna, wasn't gonna"},{"key":"b0c3028d-02d0-4b69-b6b0-310ed3468566